# 仓库文本统一按 LF 入库与检出。
#
# 背景：本仓库此前既无 .gitattributes，又依赖 core.autocrlf=true，
# 于是 git 对全部源码发出 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 警告——
# 任何人下一次 checkout 都会把整个代码树改写成 CRLF。
# 本项目全部代码均为 bare LF、无 BOM、UTF-8，行尾被改写即等同编码损坏，
# 故在此显式锁死，消除该风险。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.tar   binary
*.bin   binary
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.so    binary
*.dylib binary
*.node  binary
*.wasm  binary
*.mp3   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.eot   binary